{"data":[{"author_id":"1154174763918606339","created_at":"2026-10-28T00:11:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115234899611525250"],"id":"2115234899611525250","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":6053,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":0},"text":"昔日互联网大佬，曾炮轰抖音张一鸣😢\n如今朋友圈“化缘”，人生的落差，真让人唏嘘！\n\n百合网联合创始人慕岩，曾经也是中国互联网圈风云人物，如今却自曝财产被冻结，生活拮据，不得不在朋友圈“乞讨”\n\n10月23日，他晒出一张收款截图：一天收到12笔转账，合计5826.61元，少的只有一分钱，多的上千元。","url":"https://x.com/maoshen/status/2115234899611525250"},{"author_id":"1400012445154889731","created_at":"2026-10-28T00:07:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115234038722224454"],"id":"2115234038722224454","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3300,"impression_count":563802,"like_count":5871,"quote_count":40,"reply_count":233,"retweet_count":732},"text":"联系迷茫期的兄弟们反复观看！！\n\n每当我感到动力不足时，我就会重看这个视频。\n\n这是2008年，埃隆·马斯克在客厅里，距离破产仅剩12天，向客户推销一辆10.9万美元的汽车…… https://t.co/qd1XjVpTbm","url":"https://x.com/DtDt666/status/2115234038722224454"},{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-28T00:00:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115232082083369405"],"id":"2115232082083369405","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":74,"impression_count":82332,"like_count":611,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":71,"retweet_count":40},"text":"香港立法会议员被中国网友调侃\n\n10月26日，中国官方对台宣传媒体采访香港立法会议员李梓敬，李梓敬表示西方民主自由说得漂亮，但现实骗不了人，“能让人民幸福的才是好制度”。该言论遭到中国网友集体调侃，有网友评论，“香港越来越多的人学习表演艺术专业了”，“太想进步了”。 https://t.co/9TZHPb2jbx","url":"https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2115232082083369405"},{"author_id":"1403881130802225152","created_at":"2026-10-27T23:50:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115229694694179237"],"id":"2115229694694179237","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":26789,"like_count":34,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":49,"retweet_count":0},"text":"原来我觉得蔚来汽车会陷入危机，毕竟充电越来越快，换电这么重的商业模式太难了。但他的ES9 卖50多万，但销量非常大，查了一下可能是安全与用量扎实等。\n\n凭感觉下的判断很容易出错，尤其是也容易被社媒算法不断强化。就像问界，我感觉上不喜欢，但好像喜欢的人特别喜欢，或许也有可取之处。 https://t.co/tgDyMfnljy","url":"https://x.com/BTCdayu/status/2115229694694179237"},{"author_id":"902926941413453824","created_at":"2026-10-27T23:50:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115229579434746138"],"id":"2115229579434746138","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":72,"impression_count":309898,"like_count":1465,"quote_count":25,"reply_count":307,"retweet_count":111},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2115224590091706657","type":"quoted"}],"text":"That's very cool.\n\nThe limiting factor will become the 10 year trial/approval process. Maybe they will also use AI to review and approve? Maybe from a competing brand? 😂 https://t.co/l5O5oZYVg3","url":"https://x.com/cz_binance/status/2115229579434746138"},{"author_id":"3178231","created_at":"2026-10-27T23:49:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115229306490126432"],"id":"2115229306490126432","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":425,"impression_count":44821,"like_count":309,"quote_count":17,"reply_count":85,"retweet_count":49},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114542280535318557","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Anthropic 平台工程负责人 Katelyn Lesse：上千个 AI 智能体一起干活，还缺程序员解决四个难题\n\nAI 越来越会写代码，很多程序员开始怀疑自己的手艺还值不值钱。Anthropic 平台工程负责人 Katelyn Lesse 10 月 25 日发文说，她看到的情况正相反：接下来一两年，AI https://t.co/qzus2HXpYW","url":"https://x.com/dotey/status/2115229306490126432"},{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-27T23:40:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115227041109004553"],"id":"2115227041109004553","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":48,"impression_count":65519,"like_count":337,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":50,"retweet_count":38},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114935117319909647","type":"quoted"}],"text":"举报刘忍的博主遭买凶杀害，友人称其死后被转账造谣“敲诈被抓”\n\n10月27日，界面新闻披露“徽剑”遇害案更多细节。\n\n其友人称，徽剑遇害数日后，有人向他的支付宝转入1.1万元，再拿收款截图散布他因敲诈勒索等被警方带走的假消息，将遇害包装成“被抓”。\n\n徽剑生前持续举报电诈头目刘忍。 https://t.co/oK4E7wRN8i https://t.co/z4qZ0PzUOl","url":"https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2115227041109004553"},{"author_id":"1154174763918606339","created_at":"2026-10-27T23:38:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115226716788441308"],"id":"2115226716788441308","p